THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------
This project depends on third-party open-source software and third-party
datasets and models. Each of those components remains subject to its own
licence. In particular:

  * Base language models (for example the Qwen family) are governed by their
    respective model licences. Review the model card before commercial use.
  * Public Khmer corpora ingested through `datasets/download_public.py` carry
    per-dataset licences. The generated report at
    `data/manifests/license_report.csv` and `docs/dataset_provenance.md`
    record the licence and the commercial-review status of every source.
  * Python dependencies are listed in `requirements/`. Their licences apply as
    published by their respective authors.

No dataset flagged `prohibited_for_commercial` or `review_required` may be used
for production training until legal review has recorded an approval decision in
the manifest.

